<topic id="borders">
  <title>Borders</title>
  <shortdesc>Use extended border utilities to quickly style the border and border-radius of an element.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Borders</indexterm>
        <indexterm>CSS
          <indexterm><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></indexterm>
        </indexterm>
        <xmlatt>frame</xmlatt>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body outputclass="language-markup">
    <section>
      <title>Simple borders</title>
      <p>The <xmlatt>outputclass="border-{size}"</xmlatt> classes allow you to set a stronger border than before. The
        size is from 6 to 10, and 20. With the <codeph>.rounded-6</codeph> outputclass you can set even larger
        roundings.</p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv border="yes" padding="3" deliveryTarget="html">
      <div margin="3">
        <div
          border="6"
          bordercolor="fresh"
          rounded="6"
          padding="3"
          margin="3"
          outputclass="bg-cream text-dark"
        >.border-6, .rounded-6</div>
        <div
          border="7"
          bordercolor="primary"
          padding="3"
          margin="3"
          outputclass="border-start bg-cream text-dark"
        >.border-7</div>
        <div
          border="8"
          bordercolor="secondary"
          padding="3"
          margin="3"
          outputclass="border-end bg-cream text-dark"
        >.border-8</div>
        <div
          border="9"
          bordercolor="info"
          padding="3"
          margin="3"
          outputclass="border-top bg-cream text-dark"
        >.border-9</div>
        <div
          border="10"
          bordercolor="warning"
          padding="3"
          margin="3"
          outputclass="border-bottom bg-cream text-dark"
        >.border-10</div>
        <div
          border="20"
          bordercolor="danger"
          padding="3"
          margin="3"
          outputclass="border-start bg-cream text-dark"
        >.border-20</div>
      </div>
    </bodydiv>

    <tabbed-dialog style="pills" margin="t3">
      <section>
        <title>Specialization</title>
        <codeblock
        >&lt;div border="6" bordercolor="fresh" rounded="6" padding="3" margin="3" outputclass="bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-6, .rounded-6
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div border="7" bordercolor="primary" padding="3" margin="3" outputclass="border-start bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-7
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div border="8" bordercolor="secondary" padding="3" margin="3" outputclass="border-end bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-8
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div border="9" bordercolor="info" padding="3" margin="3" outputclass="border-top bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-9
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div border="10" bordercolor="warning" padding="3" margin="3" outputclass="border-bottom bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-10
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div border="20" bordercolor="danger" padding="3" margin="3" outputclass="border-start bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-20
&lt;/div&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
      <section>
        <title><xmlatt>outputclass</xmlatt></title>
        <codeblock>&lt;div outputclass="border border-6 border-fresh rounded-6 m-3 p-3 bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-6, .rounded-6
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div outputclass="border-start border-7 border-primary m-3 p-3 bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-7
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div outputclass="border-end border-8 border-secondary m-3 p-3 bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-8
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div outputclass="border-top border-9 border-info m-3 p-3 bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-9
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div outputclass="border-bottom border-10 border-warning m-3 p-3 bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-10
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div outputclass="border-start border-20 border-danger m-3 p-3 bg-cream text-dark"&gt;
  .border-20
&lt;/div&gt;</codeblock>
      </section>
    </tabbed-dialog>
    <section>
      <title>Offset border</title>
      <p>You can set offset borders with <xmlatt>outputclass="offset-border"</xmlatt> and the
          <xmlatt>otherprops="data-border()"</xmlatt> parameter. Parameters of the <codeph>data-border()</codeph>
        parameter in order: <codeph>{relative left position} {relative top position} {relative width change} {relative
          height change} {border width in pixels} {color}</codeph>
      </p>
    </section>
    <bodydiv outputclass="bd-example" deliveryTarget="html">
      <div outputclass="row">
        <div outputclass="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div outputclass="hover-zoom">
            <image
              outputclass="w-100 offset-border"
              otherprops="data-border(20 20 -40 -40 1 #fff)"
              scope="external"
              href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?a"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div outputclass="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div outputclass="hover-zoom w-80 mx-auto mt-5">
            <image
              outputclass="w-100 offset-border"
              otherprops="data-border(-20 -20 0 0 6 #f33)"
              scope="external"
              href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?b"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div outputclass="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div outputclass="hover-zoom w-80 mx-auto mt-5">
            <image
              outputclass="w-100 offset-border"
              otherprops="data-border(-20 -20 0 0 6 #f33) style(position: relative; z-index: 1000;)"
              scope="external"
              href="https://picsum.photos/1200/600?c"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </bodydiv>
    <codeblock>&lt;image href="..." outputclass="w-100 offset-border"
  otherprops="data-border(20 20 -40 -40 1 #fff)"/&gt;
&lt;image href="..." outputclass="w-100 offset-border" 
  otherprops="data-border(-20 -20 0 0 6 #f33)"/&gt;
&lt;image href="..." outputclass="w-100 offset-border"
  otherprops="data-border(-20 -20 0 0 6 #f33) style(position: relative; z-index: 1000;)"/&gt;</codeblock>
  </body>
</topic>
